<title>USA: AMB says to buy back five pct of shares.</title>
<headline>AMB says to buy back five pct of shares.</headline>
<dateline>MUNSTER, Ind. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMB Financial Corp said it will buy back about five percent of its outstanding common shares over 12 months.</p>
<p>The repurchased shares will be used for general corporate purposes, the bank holding company said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
